Task: list every executed test result in the test data tables.
- One entry per recorded value: e.g. blend uniformity at each sample location (TCL, TC, MBL, ...)
  for each analyte, plus Avg., RSD and Composite rows; fill weight / disintegration / assay etc.
  for each stage (Initial, Middle, Final, Composite) and batch.
- batch_sequence: 1, 2 or 3 for the 1st/2nd/3rd batch; batch_number as written in that table.
- acceptance_criteria: the criterion stated for that test.
- Skip empty result cells. Return an empty list if no results have been recorded (blank protocol
  or template).

